/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 37 0 R
/K [808 0 R 809 0 R 810 0 R 811 0 R 812 0 R 813 0 R 814 0 R]
/T <FEFF004600690067007500720065>
/Alt (A conceptual diagram illustrates the relationship between service quality and continuance intention, mediated by personal innovation. Service quality consists of reliability, assurance, entertainment, anthropomorphic factors, and tangibles. Arrows marked H1a to H1e connect these to continuance intention. Personal innovation, influencing continuance intention through arrows H2a to H2e, interacts with service quality factors.)
/ID (ID.0130)
>>
endobj
86 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 37 0 R
/K [815 0 R 816 0 R 817 0 R 818 0 R 819 0 R 820 0 R 821 0 R]
/T <FEFF004600690067007500720065>
/Alt (Line graph showing the relationship between reliability and continuance intention. The x-axis represents reliability from Low \(M-1SD\) to High \(M+1SD\). The y-axis shows continuance intention from 3.000 to 5.000. Two lines indicate Low Mod \(dashed line\) and High Mod \(solid line\), both showing an upward trend from low to high reliability.)
/ID (ID.0146)
>>
endobj
87 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 37 0 R
/K [822 0 R 823 0 R 824 0 R 825 0 R 826 0 R 827 0 R 828 0 R]
/T <FEFF004600690067007500720065>
/Alt (Line graph showing the relationship between assurance and continuance intention. Two lines represent low and high moderation levels. Both lines increase from low to high assurance, with a stronger increase for high moderation \(solid line\) compared to low moderation \(dashed line\).)
/ID (ID.0147)
>>
endobj
88 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 37 0 R
/K [829 0 R 830 0 R 831 0 R 832 0 R 833 0 R 834 0 R 835 0 R]
/T <FEFF004600690067007500720065>
/Alt (Line graph showing the relationship between entertainment and continuance intention. The x-axis is labeled Entertainment with Low \(M-1SD\) and High \(M+1SD\) values. The y-axis ranges from 3.000 to 5.000, representing continuance intention. Two lines represent Low Mod \(M-1SD\) and High Mod \(M+1SD\), both showing a positive trend.)
