<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 37 0 R
/K [836 0 R 837 0 R 838 0 R 839 0 R 840 0 R 841 0 R 842 0 R]
/T <FEFF004600690067007500720065>
/Alt (Line graph showing continuance intention against anthropomorphic levels. The y-axis ranges from 3.000 to 5.000. Two lines are plotted: Low Mod \(M-1SD\) as a dashed line and High Mod \(M+1SD\) as a solid line. Both lines positively slope from Low \(M-1SD\) to High \(M+1SD\) anthropomorphic levels, with Low Mod starting higher and intersecting High Mod at the final point.)
/ID (ID.0149)
>>
endobj
